{"id":"ffeeb732a24b7769","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-independent-set-language.md","title":"独立集判定语言","display":"df-independent-set-language — 独立集判定语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-independent-set-language","aliases":["73-df-independent-set-language"],"display":"df-independent-set-language — 独立集判定语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.2, print pp. 459–460; PDF pp. 481–482; boundary-totalized decision version","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-independent-set-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-independent-set-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-independent-set-language — 独立集判定语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f6d4d247465f3c9\" href=\"?note=4f6d4d247465f3c9\" title=\"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding\">73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.2, print pp. 459–460; PDF pp. 481–482; boundary-totalized decision version"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V_n\">\\(S\\subseteq V_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。编码采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f6d4d247465f3c9\" href=\"?note=4f6d4d247465f3c9\" title=\"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding\">73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding</a>；本地允许 k=0 或 k&gt;n，分别按精确存在条件解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\subseteq V_n\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\neg(e\\subseteq S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\subseteq V_n\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\neg(e\\subseteq S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IS}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V_n\\;(\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\land |S|\\ge k)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{IS}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V_n\\;(\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\land |S|\\ge k)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中限制 1≤k≤n；这里把边界输入也纳入语言以方便总归约，k=0 为真，k&gt;n 为假。畸形图码不在语言中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding","status":"resolved","id":"4f6d4d247465f3c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding","status":"resolved","id":"4f6d4d247465f3c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)$，$S\\subseteq V_n$，$k\\in\\mathbb N$。编码采用 [[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]；本地允许 k=0 或 k>n，分别按精确存在条件解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq V_n","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\subseteq V_n\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\neg(e\\subseteq S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{IS}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V_n\\;(\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\land |S|\\ge k)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1388,"backlinks":[{"id":"cf2cc39a9b1c7b63","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)$，$S\\subseteq V_n$；独立性采用 [[73-df-independent-set-language]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-independent-set-language|独立集判定语言]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"ecdf039ac295751f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5473eb1b238df94f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4f6d4d247465f3c9"]}